<page title="SaaS — Stack template" theme="daylight" favicon="/logo.svg">
<navbar brand="Pulse" icon="activity" links="Features:#features, Pricing:#pricing, FAQ:#faq" cta="Start free:#cta">
  <themeswitch />
</navbar>
<hero>
  <h1>Ship product updates your team actually reads</h1>
  <p class="lead">Pulse turns release notes into a living changelog your customers open every week.</p>
  <div class="stk-row">
    <button href="#cta" icon="rocket">Start free</button>
    <button variant="secondary" href="#features" icon="play">See how it works</button>
  </div>
</hero>
<section id="features">
  <h2>Features</h2>
  <grid cols="3">
    <card icon="zap" title="Instant publish">Write once, push live in seconds.</card>
    <card icon="users" title="Audience segments">Show the right notes to the right plan.</card>
    <card icon="bar-chart-2" title="Read analytics">Know which updates land.</card>
  </grid>
</section>
<section id="pricing">
  <h2>Pricing</h2>
  <grid cols="3">
    <card title="Starter">$0 · 1 project · community support</card>
    <card title="Team">$29/mo · unlimited projects · SSO</card>
    <card title="Scale">Custom · SLA · dedicated success</card>
  </grid>
</section>
<section id="faq">
  <h2>FAQ</h2>
  <md>
**Can I import from Notion?** Yes — paste or connect via API.

**Is there a free tier?** Forever, for one project.
  </md>
</section>
<section id="cta">
  <h2>Ready?</h2>
  <button icon="arrow-right">Create your workspace</button>
</section>
<footer>© Pulse. Built with Stack.</footer>
</page>
